OL,3,ACourts backlog will fall despite
OL,4,Ascrapping of jury trial plan, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe courts backlog will still fall
OL,8,Fdespite plans to curb jury trials being
OL,9,Fscrapped, the justice secretary has
OL,10,Ftold the BBC.
OL,12,FAlex Norris said introducing
OL,13,Flegislation for judge-only trials "was
OL,14,Falways going to be the most complicated
OL,15,Fto implement" and would have slowed
OL,16,Fdown reforms.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
